#: includes/class-vigsync-detector.php:120
msgid "La configuració de Vigilante al site principal és buida o inexistent."
msgstr "Vigilante's configuration on the main site is empty or missing."

#. translators: %s: nom de la clau de configuració que falta
#: includes/class-vigsync-detector.php:132
#, php-format
msgid ""
"L'esquema de Vigilante no és el esperat: falta la secció «%s». S'avorta la "
"sincronització per seguretat."
msgstr ""
"Vigilante's schema is not as expected: the «%s» section is missing. "
"Synchronization aborted for safety."

#: includes/class-vigsync-detector.php:143
msgid ""
"L'esquema de login de Vigilante ha canviat (no hi ha «custom_login_url»). "
"S'avorta la sincronització per seguretat."
msgstr ""
"Vigilante's login schema has changed («custom_login_url» is missing). "
"Synchronization aborted for safety."

#: includes/class-vigsync-network-admin.php:49
#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:35
msgid "Vigilante Network Sync"
msgstr "Vigilante Network Sync"

#: includes/class-vigsync-network-admin.php:50
msgid "Vigilante Sync"
msgstr "Vigilante Sync"

#: includes/class-vigsync-network-admin.php:84
msgid "No tens permisos per fer aquesta acció."
msgstr "You don't have permission to perform this action."

#: includes/class-vigsync-network-admin.php:109
msgid "Versió de Vigilante marcada com a compatible."
msgstr "Vigilante version marked as compatible."

#: includes/class-vigsync-network-admin.php:146
msgid "Configuració desada."
msgstr "Settings saved."

#: includes/class-vigsync-network-admin.php:149
msgid ""
"Nota: el bloqueig de login no s'ha activat perquè la xarxa és de subdominis "
"(la cookie d'autenticació no es comparteix i et deixaria fora dels subsites)."
msgstr ""
"Note: login blocking was not enabled because this is a subdomain network "
"(the authentication cookie is not shared and it would lock you out of the "
"subsites)."

#: includes/class-vigsync-network-admin.php:151
msgid ""
"Nota: el bloqueig de login no s'ha activat perquè el site principal no té el "
"custom-login de Vigilante configurat."
msgstr ""
"Note: login blocking was not enabled because the main site does not have "
"Vigilante's custom-login configured."

#. translators: 1: versió antiga, 2: versió nova
#: includes/class-vigsync-network-admin.php:190
#, php-format
msgid "Vigilante ha canviat de la versió %1$s a la %2$s."
msgstr "Vigilante has changed from version %1$s to %2$s."

#. translators: 1: versió de Vigilante instal·lada, 2: versió validada
#: includes/class-vigsync-network-admin.php:198
#, php-format
msgid ""
"La versió de Vigilante instal·lada (%1$s) és més nova que la validada per "
"aquesta versió de Vigilante Network Sync (%2$s). Revisa la compatibilitat "
"abans de confiar-hi la sincronització i el bloqueig de login."
msgstr ""
"The installed Vigilante version (%1$s) is newer than the one validated by "
"this version of Vigilante Network Sync (%2$s). Review compatibility before "
"relying on synchronization and login blocking."

#: includes/class-vigsync-network-admin.php:206
msgid "Vigilante Network Sync — canvi detectat a Vigilante"
msgstr "Vigilante Network Sync — change detected in Vigilante"

#: includes/class-vigsync-network-admin.php:209
msgid "Revisar a la pàgina de Vigilante Sync"
msgstr "Review on the Vigilante Sync page"

#. translators: %s: nom de la xarxa
#: includes/class-vigsync-network-admin.php:231
#, php-format
msgid "[%s] Vigilante ha canviat de versió"
msgstr "[%s] Vigilante has changed version"

#. translators: 1: versió nova de Vigilante, 2: versió validada, 3: URL de la pàgina
#: includes/class-vigsync-network-admin.php:237
#, php-format
msgid ""
"S'ha detectat un canvi a Vigilante (versió actual: %1$s; validada per "
"Vigilante Network Sync: %2$s).\n"
"\n"
"Revisa la compatibilitat de la sincronització i del bloqueig de login abans "
"de confiar-hi:\n"
"%3$s"
msgstr ""
"A change in Vigilante was detected (current version: %1$s; validated by "
"Vigilante Network Sync: %2$s).\n"
"\n"
"Review the compatibility of synchronization and login blocking before "
"relying on it:\n"
"%3$s"

#: includes/class-vigsync-network-admin.php:253
msgid "No tens permisos per accedir a aquesta pàgina."
msgstr "You don't have permission to access this page."

#: includes/class-vigsync-plugin.php:81
msgid "Vigilante Network Sync: bloqueig de login desactivat per seguretat"
msgstr "Vigilante Network Sync: login blocking disabled for safety"

#. translators: %s: missatge d'error de validació
#: includes/class-vigsync-plugin.php:84
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Després d'actualitzar Vigilante Network Sync, l'esquema de Vigilante no s'ha "
"pogut validar (%s). S'ha desactivat el bloqueig de login per precaució. "
"Revisa la configuració."
msgstr ""
"After updating Vigilante Network Sync, Vigilante's schema could not be "
"validated (%s). Login blocking has been disabled as a precaution. Review the "
"configuration."

#: includes/class-vigsync-sync.php:121
msgid "Vigilante no està actiu en aquesta xarxa. No s'ha sincronitzat res."
msgstr "Vigilante is not active on this network. Nothing was synchronized."

#. translators: 1: nombre de sites correctes, 2: nombre total de sites destí
#: includes/class-vigsync-sync.php:170
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Sincronització completada: %1$d de %2$d sites actualitzats correctament."
msgstr "Synchronization complete: %1$d of %2$d sites updated successfully."

#: includes/class-vigsync-sync.php:214
msgid "Ja estava sincronitzat (sense canvis)."
msgstr "Already in sync (no changes)."

#: includes/class-vigsync-sync.php:221
msgid "Configuració sincronitzada."
msgstr "Configuration synced."

#. translators: %s: llista d'entrades d'IP descartades, separades per comes
#: includes/class-vigsync-sync.php:226
#, php-format
msgid "Entrades d'IP descartades perquè no poden coincidir mai: %s."
msgstr "IP entries discarded because they can never match: %s."

#: includes/class-vigsync-sync.php:232
msgid ""
"Ja estava sincronitzat: Vigilante descarta del payload el que el seu esquema "
"no declara, i el resultat ja era el que hi havia al destí."
msgstr ""
"Already in sync: Vigilante discards whatever its schema does not declare, "
"and the result was already what the target site had."

#: includes/class-vigsync-sync.php:235
msgid "update_option ha retornat false (possible error d'escriptura)."
msgstr "update_option returned false (possible write error)."

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:37
msgid ""
"Replica la configuració de Vigilante des del site principal a la resta de "
"sites de la xarxa i, opcionalment, unifica el login."
msgstr ""
"Replicates Vigilante's configuration from the main site to the rest of the "
"network's sites and, optionally, unifies the login."

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:48
msgid ""
"Vigilante no està actiu en aquesta xarxa. Activa Vigilante per poder "
"sincronitzar."
msgstr ""
"Vigilante is not active on this network. Activate Vigilante to be able to "
"synchronize."

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:54
msgid "Xarxa de subdominis detectada."
msgstr "Subdomain network detected."

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:55
msgid ""
"El bloqueig de login unificat requereix una xarxa en subdirectori (la cookie "
"d'autenticació de WordPress es comparteix entre sites del mateix domini). En "
"una xarxa de subdominis, iniciar sessió al principal NO autentica els "
"subsites, i bloquejar-ne el login et deixaria fora dels seus wp-admin. Per "
"això el bloqueig està deshabilitat en aquesta xarxa. La sincronització de "
"configuració sí funciona normalment."
msgstr ""
"Unified login blocking requires a subdirectory network (WordPress's "
"authentication cookie is shared between sites on the same domain). On a "
"subdomain network, logging in on the main site does NOT authenticate the "
"subsites, and blocking their login would lock you out of their wp-admin. "
"That is why blocking is disabled on this network. Configuration "
"synchronization still works normally."

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:61
msgid ""
"El site principal desat ja no existeix; s'ha aplicat el principal de la "
"xarxa per defecte. Reviseu-ho a sota."
msgstr ""
"The saved main site no longer exists; the network's default main site has "
"been applied. Please review below."

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:66
#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:241
msgid "Estat"
msgstr "Status"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:70
msgid "Vigilante actiu"
msgstr "Vigilante active"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:75
msgid "No detectat"
msgstr "Not detected"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:80
msgid "Site principal (font)"
msgstr "Main site (source)"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:89
msgid "Custom-login al principal"
msgstr "Custom-login on the main site"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:94
msgid "No configurat"
msgstr "Not configured"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:99
msgid "Bloqueig de login elegible"
msgstr "Login blocking eligible"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:103
msgid "No (xarxa de subdominis: cookie d'auth no compartida)"
msgstr "No (subdomain network: auth cookie not shared)"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:105
msgid "No (cal custom-login al principal)"
msgstr "No (requires custom-login on the main site)"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:107
msgid "Sí"
msgstr "Yes"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:116
msgid "Configuració"
msgstr "Settings"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:123
msgid "Site principal"
msgstr "Main site"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:132
msgid ""
"El site del qual es llegeix la configuració de Vigilante. Per defecte, el "
"principal de la xarxa (normalment #1)."
msgstr ""
"The site whose Vigilante configuration is read. Defaults to the network's "
"main site (usually #1)."

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:136
msgid "Sincronització"
msgstr "Synchronization"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:140
msgid "Copiar també el slug de custom-login al destí"
msgstr "Also copy the custom-login slug to the target"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:144
msgid "(obligatori mentre el bloqueig de login als subsites estigui actiu)"
msgstr "(required while the subsite login block is active)"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:149
msgid "Copiar també les llistes d'IPs i User-Agents (whitelist/blacklist)"
msgstr "Also copy the IP and User-Agent lists (whitelist/blacklist)"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:155
msgid ""
"Copiar també la configuració de 2FA (recomanat: Vigilante ja la decideix per "
"a tota la xarxa)"
msgstr ""
"Also copy the 2FA settings (recommended: Vigilante already decides them for "
"the whole network)"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:157
msgid ""
"Copiar també la configuració de 2FA (només recomanat si el mètode és e-mail)"
msgstr ""
"Also copy the 2FA configuration (only recommended if the method is e-mail)"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:162
msgid ""
"Per defecte es preserven de cada site les llistes d'IPs i User-Agents, la "
"CSP report-uri, la configuració de 2FA i els destinataris addicionals "
"d'avisos."
msgstr ""
"By default each site keeps its own IP and User-Agent lists, its CSP report-"
"uri, its 2FA settings and its additional alert recipients."

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:163
msgid ""
"Aquesta versió de Vigilante decideix el segon factor per a TOTA la xarxa: la "
"política és la unió del que demana cada site, així que n'hi ha prou que un "
"subsite el demani perquè el compte l'hagi de passar, arribi el login per on "
"arribi. Per això ara és recomanable copiar-lo, i ja no hi ha el risc "
"d'abans: la matrícula TOTP també es busca a la taula de tots els sites que "
"el compte pot arribar, de manera que copiar la configuració no deixa ningú "
"sense poder validar."
msgstr ""
"This version of Vigilante decides the second factor for the WHOLE network: "
"the policy is the union of what every site asks for, so one subsite asking "
"is enough for the account to have to pass it, whichever site the login "
"arrives at. That is why copying it is now the sensible choice, and the old "
"risk is gone: the TOTP enrolment is also looked up in the table of every "
"site the account can reach, so copying the settings no longer leaves anyone "
"unable to verify."

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:165
msgid ""
"Per defecte es preserven de cada site les llistes d'IPs i User-Agents, la "
"CSP report-uri, la configuració de 2FA i els destinataris addicionals "
"d'avisos. Atenció: amb el mètode TOTP, els secrets viuen en taules per-blog "
"i no es poden sincronitzar; copiar la config de 2FA deixaria els usuaris "
"sense poder validar al destí."
msgstr ""
"By default each site keeps its own IP and User-Agent lists, CSP report-uri, "
"two-factor configuration and additional notification recipients. Careful: "
"with the TOTP method the secrets live in per-blog tables and cannot be "
"synced, so copying the 2FA configuration would leave users unable to "
"validate on the target site."

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:169
msgid "Segon factor divergent a la xarxa."
msgstr "Second factor differs across the network."

#. translators: %s: llista de sites, separats per comes
#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:173
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Aquests sites demanen un segon factor diferent del site principal: %s. Com "
"que Vigilante ara suma el que demana cada site, aquesta diferència afecta "
"comptes de tota la xarxa. Marca la casella de dalt i sincronitza per "
"unificar-la, o revisa la configuració de 2FA d'aquests sites."
msgstr ""
"These sites ask for a different second factor than the main site: %s. Since "
"Vigilante now adds up what every site asks for, that difference affects "
"accounts across the whole network. Tick the box above and sync to unify it, "
"or review the 2FA settings of those sites."

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:180
msgid ""
"Vigilante 2.9.8 o superior detectat: els ajustos que només s'escriuen a wp-"
"config.php i al .htaccess (capçaleres de seguretat, hardening de WP i les "
"proteccions de fitxers) ja NO es copien als subsites. Aquests dos fitxers "
"són únics a tota la xarxa i només els escriu el site principal, així que "
"copiar-hi res no tindria cap efecte."
msgstr ""
"Vigilante 2.9.8 or later detected: the settings that are only written to wp-"
"config.php and .htaccess (security headers, WP hardening and the file "
"protections) are no longer copied to subsites. Those two files are shared by "
"the whole network and only the main site writes them, so copying anything "
"there would have no effect."

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:186
msgid "Login unificat"
msgstr "Unified login"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:190
msgid ""
"Bloquejar el login als subsites (el login només es fa al site principal)"
msgstr "Block login on subsites (login is only performed on the main site)"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:193
msgid ""
"Deshabilitat: la xarxa és de subdominis i la cookie d'autenticació no es "
"comparteix; el bloqueig et deixaria fora dels wp-admin dels subsites."
msgstr ""
"Disabled: this is a subdomain network and the authentication cookie is not "
"shared; blocking would lock you out of the subsites' wp-admin."

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:195
msgid ""
"Deshabilitat: cal que el site principal tingui el custom-login de Vigilante "
"configurat."
msgstr "Disabled: the main site must have Vigilante's custom-login configured."

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:197
msgid ""
"Els subsites respondran un 404 a qualsevol intent de login (wp-login.php i "
"slug), sense revelar el slug del principal. Inicia sessió un sol cop al "
"principal; la cookie de xarxa et dona accés a tots els subsites."
msgstr ""
"Subsites will return a 404 to any login attempt (wp-login.php and slug), "
"without revealing the main site's slug. Log in once on the main site; the "
"network cookie gives you access to all subsites."

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:198
msgid ""
"Mentre estigui actiu, el slug de custom-login es copia sempre als subsites: "
"sense ell, Vigilante no hi captura la còpia de la pàgina 404 del tema ni hi "
"respon 404 a wp-admin, i el bloqueig es distingiria d'una pàgina inexistent."
msgstr "While it is active, the custom-login slug is always copied to the subsites: without it, Vigilante does not capture the copy of the theme's 404 page there nor answer 404 on wp-admin, and the block would be distinguishable from a page that does not exist."

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:202
msgid "Subsites sense la URL de login de Vigilante."
msgstr "Subsites without Vigilante's login URL."

#. translators: %s: llista de sites, separats per comes
#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:206
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Aquests subsites encara no tenen el custom-login de Vigilante: %s. El "
"bloqueig hi serveix una pàgina 404 plana que es distingeix d'una pàgina "
"inexistent, i wp-admin hi redirigeix a wp-login.php en lloc de donar 404. "
"Fes «Sincronitza ara» per copiar-hi el slug del principal."
msgstr "These subsites do not have Vigilante's custom login yet: %s. The block serves them a plain 404 page that can be told apart from a page that does not exist, and wp-admin redirects to wp-login.php instead of returning 404. Click “Sync now” to copy the main site's slug to them."

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:215
msgid "Email d'avisos"
msgstr "Notification email"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:218
msgid "Rebrà un avís quan Vigilante canviï de versió (un cop per versió)."
msgstr ""
"Will receive a notice when Vigilante changes version (once per version)."

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:223
msgid "Desar configuració"
msgstr "Save settings"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:227
msgid "Sincronitzar ara"
msgstr "Sync now"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:231
msgid ""
"Replica la configuració del site principal a la resta de sites de la xarxa."
msgstr ""
"Replicates the main site's configuration to the rest of the network's sites."

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:232
msgid "Sincronitza ara"
msgstr "Sync now"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:236
msgid "Resultat de la sincronització"
msgstr "Synchronization result"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:240
msgid "Site"
msgstr "Site"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:242
msgid "Detall"
msgstr "Details"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:253
msgid "Correcte"
msgstr "OK"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:254
msgid "Sense canvis"
msgstr "No changes"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:255
msgid "Error"
msgstr "Error"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:268
msgid "Compatibilitat amb Vigilante"
msgstr "Vigilante compatibility"

#. translators: 1: versió validada, 2: versió coneguda
#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:273
#, php-format
msgid ""
"Versió de Vigilante validada per aquesta release: %1$s. Última versió "
"marcada com a compatible: %2$s."
msgstr ""
"Vigilante version validated by this release: %1$s. Last version marked as "
"compatible: %2$s."

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:282
msgid "He revisat: marca la versió actual com a compatible"
msgstr "I've reviewed it: mark the current version as compatible"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:286
msgid "Recomanacions"
msgstr "Recommendations"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:288
msgid "Mode bloqueig (recomanat per a 2FA un sol cop, xarxa multi-idioma):"
msgstr "Block mode (recommended for single 2FA, multilingual network):"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:289
msgid ""
"configura el custom-login al site principal, mantén el slug copiat als "
"subsites (sync) i activa el bloqueig de login. El login només funciona al "
"principal; els subsites responen 404 sense revelar el slug. El 2FA s'enrola "
"un sol cop al principal i la cookie de xarxa cobreix la resta."
msgstr ""
"configure the custom-login on the main site, keep the slug copied to the "
"subsites (sync) and enable login blocking. Login only works on the main "
"site; subsites return 404 without revealing the slug. 2FA is set up once on "
"the main site and the network cookie covers the rest."

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:290
msgid "Mode independent:"
msgstr "Independent mode:"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:291
msgid ""
"mateix slug a tots els sites (via sync) i bloqueig desactivat. Cada site "
"amaga el seu propi login; el 2FA s'enrola per-site (recorda: amb TOTP, no "
"sincronitzis la config de 2FA)."
msgstr ""
"same slug on all sites (via sync) and blocking disabled. Each site hides its "
"own login; 2FA is set up per-site (remember: with TOTP, do not synchronize "
"the 2FA config)."

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:292
msgid "Recuperació d'emergència:"
msgstr "Emergency recovery:"

#: includes/views/network-settings-page.php:293
msgid ""
"defineix VIGSYNC_DISABLE_LOGIN_GUARD a true al wp-config.php per desactivar "
"el bloqueig sense tocar la base de dades (també s'accepta l'antic "
"VIGSYNC_DISABLE_REDIRECT). El site principal mai es bloqueja."
msgstr ""
"define VIGSYNC_DISABLE_LOGIN_GUARD to true in wp-config.php to disable "
"blocking without touching the database (the legacy VIGSYNC_DISABLE_REDIRECT "
"is also accepted). The main site is never blocked."

#: vigilante-network-sync.php:69
msgid ""
"Vigilante Network Sync requereix una instal·lació WordPress multisite. "
"Desactiva el plugin."
msgstr ""
"Vigilante Network Sync requires a WordPress multisite installation. "
"Deactivate the plugin."
